      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788342548032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "URL shortener like Bit.ly\n\nBit.ly is a url shortening service that convert the long url into shorter, manageable links\n\n\nfunctional requirements \n\n- convert long url to short url\n    - optionally support custom alias\n    - optionally support an expiration time\n- redirect to original url from short url\n\n\nNon functional requirements \n\n- low latency on redirects \n- Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls \n- Ensure uniqueness of short code \n- High availability, eventual consistency for url shortening\n\n\nCore Entities\n\n-  url\n- user \n\nAPI\n\nPOST /url  -> short url\n    body {\n        long url,\n        alias,\n        expirationTime?\n        user\n    }\n\nGET {short url} -> Redirect to OriginalURL\n\n \n  \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "URL shortener like Bit.ly\n\nBit.ly is a url shortening service that convert the long url into shorter, manageable links\n\n\nfunctional requirements \n\n- convert long url to short url\n    - optionally support custom alias\n    - optionally support an expiration time\n- redirect to original url from short url\n\n\nNon functional requirements \n\n- low latency on redirects \n- Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls \n- Ensure uniqueness of short code \n- High availability, eventual consistency for url shortening\n\n\nCore Entities\n\n-  url\n- user \n\nAPI\n\nPOST /url  -> short url\n    body {\n        long url,\n        alias,\n        expirationTime?\n        user\n    }\n\nGET {short url} -> Redirect to OriginalURL\n\n \n  \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
